00:00:15.306 --> 00:00:16.433
One of the most fascinating 

00:00:16.433 --> 00:00:17.392
stories is the story 

00:00:17.392 --> 00:00:18.059
of Drew Thornton. 

00:00:19.227 --> 00:00:20.603
Thornton was a police officer. 

00:00:20.979 --> 00:00:21.855
He was an addict. 

00:00:22.063 --> 00:00:23.314
Addicted to adrenaline

00:00:23.314 --> 00:00:24.441
and excitement. 

00:00:24.774 --> 00:00:26.818
People say he was as ludicrous

00:00:26.818 --> 00:00:27.444
as ludicrous

00:00:27.444 --> 00:00:27.902
could be. 

00:00:28.028 --> 00:00:29.195
He had about 70 pounds

00:00:29.195 --> 00:00:30.071
of cocaine on him. 

00:00:30.071 --> 00:00:31.448
He had a James Bond 

00:00:31.448 --> 00:00:33.575
wristwatch that shot tear gas.

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:34.617
A lot of people noted 

00:00:34.617 --> 00:00:36.828
he was wearing Gucci loafers.

00:00:36.995 --> 00:00:38.246
Well, this is very strange. 

00:00:39.664 --> 00:00:40.832
He developed one of the 

00:00:40.832 --> 00:00:42.083
biggest organizations 

00:00:42.083 --> 00:00:43.084
I've ever seen. 

00:00:47.547 --> 00:00:49.466
It has corruption, murder, 

00:00:49.466 --> 00:00:50.967
gun running, you name it. 

00:00:53.636 --> 00:00:54.387
Holy crap. 

00:00:54.387 --> 00:00:55.096
You would never 

00:00:55.096 --> 00:00:55.847
believe this happened.

